s. Zombies III'.&quot;&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;say Edmund &quot;Genial.&quot;&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;say Berta &quot;¡Manos a la obra!&quot;&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;move Berta to 111,105 #face:Right await&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;await 400&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;animate-actor Berta RaiseArm #preserve await&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;play-sound FenceOpen&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;play-animation ThemeParkEntrance-Door Open&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;animate-actor Berta RaiseArm #reverse await&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;await 400&#x9;&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;say Berta &quot;¡¡Andando, hermanito!!&quot;&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;move Berta to 150,99 await&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;unparent Berta&#xD;&#xA;}" /></Folder><Folder Name="Stars"><Script SourceCode="Thing ThemeParkEntrance-Star1 Class:Prop&#xD;&#xA;{&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;put this into ThemeParkEntrance #at:28,6&#xD;&#xA;}&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Load ThemeParkEntrance-Star1&#xD;&#xA;{&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;=&gt; Opacity = .9&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;opacity-tween this Linear to .7 duration 120 #bounces:-1&#xD;&#xA;}" /><Script SourceCode="Thing ThemeParkEntrance-Star2 Class:Prop&#xD;&#xA;{&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;put this into ThemeParkEntrance #at:52,16&#xD;&#xA;}&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Load ThemeParkEntrance-Star2&#xD;&#xA;{&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;=&gt; Opacity = .9&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;opacity-tween this Linear to .7 duration 100 #bounces:-1&#xD;&#xA;}" /><Script SourceCode="Thing ThemeParkEntrance-Star3 Class:Prop&#xD;&#xA;{&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;=&gt; Scale = .5&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;put this into ThemeParkEntrance #at:100,10&#xD;&#xA;}&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Load ThemeParkEntrance-Star3&#xD;&#xA;{&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;=&gt; Opacity = .9&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;opacity-tween this Linear to .7 duration 160 #bounces:-1&#xD;&#xA;}" /></Folder></Folder></Folder><Folder Name="TowerRoom" IsExpanded="true"><Script IsDocumentOpen="true" CaretOffset="67" SourceCode="Room TowerRoom Class:ProceduralRoom Persistent&#xD;&#xA;{&#xD;&#xA;}&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;Enter TowerRoom&#xD;&#xA;{&#xD;&#xA;&#x9;start-routine IncomingGhostCar-Intro await&#xD;&#xA;}" /></Folder></Folder></Project>